flowchart LR
    accTitle: Typical NEL workflow
    accDescr: Create a namespace, train entities and regex rules, commit a snapshot, extract from text, add test cases, run the tests, and roll back if a run regresses.
    A["1. Create namespace"] --> B["2. Add entities<br>and surface texts"]
    B --> C["3. Add regex rules<br>(optional)"]
    C --> D["4. Commit a snapshot"]
    D --> E["5. Extract from text"]
    E --> F["6. Save test cases"]
    F --> G["7. Run tests"]
    G -- "regression" --> H["Roll back to a commit"]
    G -- "all pass" --> B
